    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Alaura GK.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107588063340558638308/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW4CD485w7Ia9sAmw4rW2LnpvQGCDQJKlO9SVrT76n87cGBkoXv=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "This is our third time coming here and honestly, they deserve every bit of this review. The food is always incredible — the portions, the taste, the freshness… everything is just delightful.\n\nTheir cocktails, poutine, burgers, chicken popcorn — everything we’ve tried has been amazing every single time.\nMy most fav drink is spicy mango. Their Mexican poutine is just THE BEST. I’ve never had better poutine than theirs.\n\nBut what makes this place even better is the staff. All the youngsters working here are so sweet, welcoming, and genuinely great at what they do. Every visit feels comfortable because of how kind and attentive they are.\n(I wish I asked the girl’s name who served us 😔🫶🏻 you’re doing such a good job. On December 4, Thursday 7:45PM -)\nWe never had anything negative to say — just consistent good vibes and delicious food. Definitely one of the best local spots around. Highly recommend! 🫶✨\n\n(All the pictures from 3of my visits 😁🫶🏻)",
        "time": 1765040728,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Adonis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118160446114908717639/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUDXMpxY09GkaltR4TPo48jxVqeDwG-3jvyi48XvekwWL9eTqnI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Eating at this restaurant was one of the coolest outdoor dining experiences we've ever had.  Their patio beside the river was very nice and beautiful, with good vibes and atmosphere.  We liked their food too.  Their burgers were juicy, delicious, and high-quality.  The staff were very nice and friendly, too.  The indoor dining rooms were very interesting and well decorated.  We enjoyed our time here.",
        "time": 1759354870,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ray Boyington",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100194909006761105381/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUiuYOTdXTi6iR_ldFDtIGFF_8qj5qx9jaMBd5gTIdfh6FWyel4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Fantastic restaurant and hidden gem!\n\nI almost skipped out on this spot because I thought that \"it was just sandwiches and basic fare\" but I'm so glad we stopped by. Love the inside decor and the creative twists on the food!\n\nWe ended up with the duck burger, the fois gras, the bang bang shrimp tacos, and French onion soup. EVERYTHING was delicious!\n\n(To note for Americans, the primary language is French here but everyone also spoke English, which helped my rusty knowledge of French. They also have a QR code for an English menu.)",
        "time": 1764132075,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Clement KANJ",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112266346672615415608/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXhK1UQfAeGVFV9zNPmJ-IOOwcs2tQ1BdbCPI0HymlkxCw1E72-UQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "📍 Close to Montreal, at the Vaudreuil-Dorion waterfront, we discovered Patate et Persil — and what a gem! 💎✨\nWe were amazed by the setup: vintage, simple, and oh-so-comfy 🪑🕰️. The atmosphere is easy-going, and the staff are super friendly 😊💬. The view of the water was incredibly relaxing 🌊☀️.\nWe absolutely enjoyed our time here — the food was super delicious 🍔🍟🌯! Portion sizes were generous, and prices very reasonable 💰👍.\nSpecial shoutout to the variety of well-prepared and tasty vegan options 🌱🥗 — truly impressive! And don’t miss the drinks and cocktails 🍹🍸, with both alcoholic and non-alcoholic options available 🍷🥤.\n✅ Definitely a place to mark on your calendars! 🗓️❤️",
